                One dashboard. Every mandate.
              </h1>
        <h2
          class="font-nohemi max-md:text-[26px]! md:max-lg:text-4xl! lg:text-[36px]! text-white leading-[1.14]! font-medium text-left max-w-116 w-full m-0"
